WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.730
The treatment of prisoners of war is regulated by the Ormond Treaty.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.320
I doubt they'll do anything too absurd.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.030
Come.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:22.160
The court is now in session for the trial of these three prisoners.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:28.590
The trial will be held in King Heinz Nerich Windermere's presence

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.670
at his special request.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.880
King Heinz...

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.960
<i>Our kiss will link us from one end to the other</i>

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:45.390
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:50.240
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.040
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.560
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.180
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:19.060
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:22.910
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:29.880
<i>Our cores crash into each other, confirming our uncovered love</i>

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:40.900
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:46.790
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.510
<i>Charm me with your passion, pray to the heavens</i>

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:52.880
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.140
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:01.620
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:12.440
The tracker shows Hayate's group in front of the castle, and Mikumo near the system.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.440
Looks like Hayate's group got caught.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:23.080
The keenness of your hearing would put a cat to shame.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.750
Berger?!

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:34.420
Chaos' navigation satellites use parts produced by some of our partner corporations.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.550
I guess we'll have to check all of our gear now.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.180
Yeah.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.420
Why is His Majesty doing this?

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.420
Silence, Bogue.

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.890
Where is Lord Roid?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.390
He is busy inspecting the sanctum.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.060
The trial shall proceed in his absence.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.380
Where are we?

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:09.540
I swear upon the Great Wind

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:17.050
that I, Heinz Nerich Windermere, will abide by the 
decision of the Three Wings, regardless of outcome.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.570
As this is a simplified trial,

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:24.180
questioning of the defendants by the prosecution and defense likewise shall be omitted.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.560
What about these handcuffs?!

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.780
In a proper trial, the defendants 
aren't supposed to be restrained!

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:32.350
You are not to speak unless requested.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.690
The defendants are charged with 
armed incursion into our territory,

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:40.950
aggravated assault, and defilement of our sacred skies.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.660
Do you acknowledge these crimes?

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:47.430
Because you asked before you flew over our heads with your VFs?!

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.680
How dare you spout this filth in His Majesty's presence!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.490
It is fine.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:52.620
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.350
Will you give me some time?

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.250
Very well.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:04.220
I hear this Chaos you belong 
to is not part of the military.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.570
Furthermore, you are an Earthling.

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:11.140
And you have Zentradi blood.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.980
As far as I know, you were born 
outside the Globular Cluster.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.080
Why do you fight us?

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:20.050
We are contracted to protect the Globular Cluster.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.140
It's our mission.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:24.460
So you fight because it is your job?

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:25.570
That's not all.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.220
Then why?

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.410
I want to protect the people

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.500
who live on Ragna and the other planets.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.250
Freyja Wion.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.230
Why do you sing?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:47.640
I... Walküre sings to help people across the galaxy who were affected by the Var.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.250
I do not wish to hear why Walküre sings. I wish to hear why you sing.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:05.660
When I sing, this feeling inside me...

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.120
this happy feeling inside me takes over!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:15.180
If I could share this happiness with the people of the galaxy, perhaps war won't be waged anymore.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.760
Feelings taking over you when you sing?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.860
I have never felt that way.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:31.600
When I heard you sing, I could feel the color of warmth.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:36.110
That color reminded me of... yes, the sun.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:39.560
That other singer, her color reminded me of...

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:41.950
A rainbow!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:45.290
No, the color of the stars.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:48.810
Beautiful and close, yet so very distant.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.990
Frightening in a way.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:57.210
Your Majesty's singing scares me even more.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:00.380
It's transparent and colorless.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.460
Colorless?

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:05.770
It's beautiful and clear, but there is nothing beyond it.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.510
It feels empty.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.010
Empty?!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.650
Such insolence.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:15.100
Your Majesty, she is also charged with high treason.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.230
The sentence for treason is death.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.850
May we at least execute her first?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:20.850
Fuck you!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.440
Restrain him!

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:25.190
Hayate!

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.680
Trial, my ass!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.240
You're just putting on a show before executing us!

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.510
There is no prosecution, defense, or jury.

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.960
This is in violation of the Ormond Treaty!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.580
As you do not belong to the 
armed forces of the NUN Spacy,

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.210
you are not considered a combatant.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.550
Therefore, the treaty does not apply.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.420
What?!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.720
Your Majesty! The outside world is so full of wonderful things that can't be seen or heard here!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.770
Silence!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:59.920
But... But sometimes the wind 
is similar to Windermere's, so...

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.400
I told you to shut up!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.650
Can't you stop the war?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.180
Freyja!

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.120
Hayate!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.790
You filthy vermin.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:25.630
Stand down.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.130
That is enough.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:43.980
That's Captain Wright's... Hayate's father's plane!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.770
We tuned it last night.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.230
I believe it's flyable.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.660
Its leg units were removed as well,

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.990
so you should be able to ride in the compartment.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.230
What is your objective?

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:59.120
I am a merchant.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.140
I expect appropriate compensation later.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.460
It is time for my departure, so if you would excuse me.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.490
Departure?

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.910
We're withdrawing from Windermere for now.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.430
There was a change of circumstances.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.060
I wish you all good luck.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.200
Can we really trust him?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.890
He's a cunning man.

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.780
If he wanted to, we'd be in his trap already.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.670
I should verify it really is flyable.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:35.610
Please do.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.330
You are in the King's presence.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:42.540
You may not spill blood at his feet.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.370
I beg His Majesty's pardon.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:51.670
When I intersected with your wind, I felt pain.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:54.840
I felt dread and sadness.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:59.170
As the war continues, others will feel like that too.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.310
I cannot stop yet.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:06.260
Our justice has yet to be carried out.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.470
Your Majesty!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:11.870
Your Majesty, the defendants displayed no regret for their crimes and acted provocative.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.860
We do not believe further deliberation would be meaningful.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:18.260
We wish to deliver a verdict.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.080
Very well.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.820
I, Wing of One, declare all three defendants guilty.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:28.040
The Wind of Judgment shall decide whether it is a capital crime.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.400
I, Wing of Two, agree.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.510
I, Wing of Three, agree.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.400
The Three Wings spoke of the same wind.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.720
The three defendants are declared guilty.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.430
They are to be executed.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.740
That is your true form.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.410
Do you have any memories of it?

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.140
I suppose you do not.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.930
I have been inspecting you since last night.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:09.830
As I feared...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.930
What?

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:16.770
You are an artificial life form.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:22.330
Seven years ago, in the chaos of war,

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:26.270
an object was stolen from this sanctum.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.590
I do not know what it was,

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:35.550
but I suspect the stolen object helped Lady M revive you, the Star Singer.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:42.490
The Star Singer is a legend passed down on Windermere.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:46.830
Originally, she was a priestess the Protoculture left by our side.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:51.490
Over time, her powers were passed on to the Wind Singers.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:59.700
Reviving the Star Singer is beyond my imagination.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.400
They obscured the truth and used you for their own gains.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:07.180
Perhaps they were afraid of you...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.660
Of your power.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:21.490
I'm... the Star Singer?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.570
That is correct.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:28.700
Even if your memories are gone, your body should still remember

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.160
the winds of Windermere...

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.740
and your songs.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:45.680
I remember this from the picture books I read when I was little.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.890
The bad people who opposed the King

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.740
would walk off a cliff over the abyss

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.040
and fall to the wind.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.110
So we're supposed to jump off that thing?

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.560
It's pointless.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.240
You cannot escape.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.450
The fight does not end until one dies.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.800
I liked the way you fly.

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:13.960
You seemed to think too much.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:18.420
If you flew with a clear mind, the 
wind would have carried you.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.200
It is a shame.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.130
Son of Immelmann.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.580
Your wind lacked the will to kill.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:30.570
During wartime, you fly to kill.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.250
Messer told me the same.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:36.340
Messer?

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.260
The Grim Reaper.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.660
I can't...

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.600
I can't taint Freyja's songs with blood.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.660
But it doesn't matter. The next 
time we meet, I'll exceed you.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:53.450
Mark my words.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.250
The sentence shall now be carried out.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:59.130
You're first, traitor!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:04.880
Normally, you wouldn't be granted the honor of becoming one with the wind of Windermere.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.990
Be grateful for His Majesty's clemency.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.050
I'll go first.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.680
No one gave you a choice!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.010
Very well.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.920
Sir White Knight?

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.550
It's his last wish.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.520
Grant it.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:21.230
You don't know that it's my last.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:21.940
Hayate...

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.160
Mirage, take care of Freyja.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.470
On my life.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.520
I trust you.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.660
Stop! Hayate!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.690
Hayate! Hayate!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.730
Hayate!

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:54.510
Nice wind.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.190
Is he trying to buy time? What a fool.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.440
Hayate!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:42.860
The wings of the demon?!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.030
Dad's plane?!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.360
You guys okay?!

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:01.880
Yeah!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.090
Freyja! Mirage!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:05.300
Time to fly!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:07.010
Fly?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.040
Jump and you'll fly!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:14.600
Don't let them get away!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.440
Those bastards...

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.290
That was just a distraction?

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:45.250
We will now commence a tactical 
show to destroy the system!

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.210
Protect Walküre!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.420
Roger!

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:53.330
A tactical show without Mikumo?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.790
Don't worry! We can do it!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.890
And we're talking about Kumo-Kumo.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:01.020
I bet she's gonna pull a crazy entrance and blast onto stage out of nowhere.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.650
She's the kind to steal the show.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.210
Let's do it!

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.070
Roger!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.130
I'll head to pick up my Siegfried!

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.330
Don't let your guard down!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.840
You too, Captain!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.750
You cheeky little...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:38.900
<i>Another drop of light comes together inside this overflowing darkness</i>

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:44.850
<i>We've come a long way, singing till our throats dried up</i>

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:40.970
Walküre?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:51.570
<i>With every miracle we caused with music, we grew closer together</i>

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:51.570
Hayate...

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:58.490
<i>We blew away even the heaviest and darkest atmosphere</i>

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.620
Captain Wright.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:04.020
<i>With all five of us, we opened up artificial skies into endless ones</i>

00:16:58.760 --> 00:16:59.450
Incoming?

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:11.120
<i>That's the reality and that's what matters</i>

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.260
White Knight!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.260
<i>Look up now</i>

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.970
Show me how you fly!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:18.550
<i>If you're going to give up and fall, do it after everything is over</i>

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:18.550
I told you to clear your mind when you fly.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:25.260
<i>We will sing to bring you the world into your crumbling hands</i>

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:24.890
What?!

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:31.280
<i>Our strong friendship will revive our fading volume</i>

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:40.170
<i>We will amplify it to the skies and make our music incredible</i>

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.320
Crap!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:37.950
All at once!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:38.820
Not bad.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.510
Walküre...

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:48.540
I've come to realize they were just a cover to hide you.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.540
No! I'm no Star Singer!

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:58.850
<i>Gentle adults cry from pain they can empathize with</i>

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.300
Rudanjal Rom Mayan.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:02.600
<i>Words aren't necessary; we'll be right there with—</i>

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.060
Fre-Fre!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.280
Makina!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.310
Makina!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.960
Makina was taken out?!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:13.690
No way!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.400
Makina...

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.030
Out of the way.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.700
What is it, Makina?

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.460
The instrumental part is almost over...

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:33.630
Sing!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.840
<i>Look up now</i>

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:46.420
<i>If we lose even just one of us, there's no point</i>

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:52.990
<i>So we just believe in our bonds and believe in you</i>

00:18:54.020 --> 00:19:00.700
<i>If you're going to give up and fall, do it after everything is over</i>

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:07.080
<i>We will sing to bring you flowers blooming in full</i>

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.080
The system...

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:13.770
<i>Our volume is coming back and with it, everyone's smile</i>

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:16.000
Rudanjal Rom Mayan.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:21.030
<i>We will sing our song of joy so it reaches infinitely far</i>

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:27.060
<i>Until destiny gives up</i>

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.130
Captain!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.270
Cavalry's here!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:32.690
Dammit...

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.900
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:09.180
Mikumo?

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.680
She's in there?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.440
Mikumo?

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.200
But this song...

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.340
Freyja!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.660
Mikumo...

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:40.000
Is this the Song of the Stars?

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.310
Mikumo?

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:01.480
Operation aborted! We're leaving!

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.370
Roger.

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.740
Hurry up!

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.030
Makina...

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.860
Mission 24: Fatal Judgment

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:17.020
<i>I stand on the burning wreckage</i>

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:23.740
<i>I don't know for how long or why at all</i>

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:28.500
<i>The flames around are drowning me</i>

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.000
<i>Finding what I seek feels so pointless now</i>

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:40.750
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:47.130
<i>Choose the future even if it's worse than the past</i>

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Let's go</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:51.100
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:54.020
<i>Sing so hard until it hurts</i>

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>Until your soul finally settles down</i>

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:02.720
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:23:02.720 --> 00:23:05.550
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:11.370
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:16.320
<i>Ah, just remember this, baby</i>

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:23.050
<i>You'll find forgiveness in a chaotic climax</i>

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:31.800
Star Singer Mikumo Guynemer.

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:36.560
May your voice resonate throughout the entire galaxy!

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.810
Next time: Star Singer

